{
  "changelog": "one-novel-skill 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release with a fully automated Chinese novel writing workflow, from project setup to long-form daily updates.\n- Includes advanced anti-AI detection: four-layer protection, 12 L2-level checks, multi-perspective adversarial review, timeline verification, and writer\u2019s constitution.\n- Zero-configuration adaptive LLM support: auto-discovers and leverages Ollama, OpenClaw, DeepSeek, OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, Tongyi Qianwen, Zhipu, Moonshot, Baichuan, and custom endpoints.\n- Granular file operations and progress/state tracking for novel projects, supporting local and hosted modes.\n- Built-in chapter contract system, detailed pre-writing analysis, and deep detection/AI flavor removal.\n- Special modes for short stories and platform-specific requirements.",
